  "question": "Let $y = (x-1)^2(x-3)$.<br /><br /> (a) Find points where tangent is parallel to x-axis. <br /><br />(b) Where is tangent parallel to line x+2y=0? <br /><br />(c) If curve is normal to y-axis at (a,b), find possible a.",
